<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 0.34 points off FTSE, Feb 3.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 0.34 points off FTSE, Feb 3.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on February 3 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 0.34 points off the FTSE 100 that day.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>    * Asda Group				 0.81  1.013    0.173</p>
<p>    * Siebe					4.90  6.125    0.172</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
